  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">김정식 선생님께서 만든 프로그램을 조별 학습지로 만들어서 활용했습니다.<br>&#160;<br>준비물 : 각 개인별 패드 1개, 조별학습지와 문제카드<br>&#160;<br>조별학습지 (조별로 한 묶음 나눠주기)</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/08e90d806ef7484b23d9f087adba4f3890878683?download\" data-file-name=\"화학식 만들기 조별학습지(12문제).hwpx\" data-file-size=\"141895\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D1278%26fileid%3D10%26regdt%3D20260401160213&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F08e90d806ef7484b23d9f087adba4f3890878683')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">화학식 만들기 조별학습지(12문제)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">138.57KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>문제카드 (조별로 단면인쇄해서 한 묶음 나눠주기)</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/14c8f94ad91b0dc39b8624a2e62b6c81d5b4743d?download\" data-file-name=\"화학식 만들기 문제카드(12문제).hwpx\" data-file-size=\"41080\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D1278%26fileid%3D11%26regdt%3D20260401160213&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F14c8f94ad91b0dc39b8624a2e62b6c81d5b4743d')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">화학식 만들기 문제카드(12문제)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">40.12KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>[1단계 문제]<br><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/changesticker/changesticker.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/changesticker/changesticker.html</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"changesticker\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"sciencej1.cafe24.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/changesticker/changesticker.html\" data-og-url=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/changesticker/changesticker.html\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/changesticker/changesticker.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/changesticker/changesticker.html\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">changesticker</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">sciencej1.cafe24.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>[2단계 문제]<br><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/changesticker/changesticker2.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/changesticker/changesticker2.html</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"changesticker2\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"sciencej1.cafe24.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/changesticker/changesticker2.html\" data-og-url=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/changesticker/changesticker2.html\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/changesticker/changesticker2.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/changesticker/changesticker2.html\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">changesticker2</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">sciencej1.cafe24.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>조별학습지와 문제 카드를 만들어서 아이들보고 하나씩 자르라고 했어요.<br>&#160;<br>&lt;설명&gt;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/860953301c40832c308cef8a19d9588484f9fe58\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/860953301c40832c308cef8a19d9588484f9fe58\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b568506a31b9f888e117dbeba01529c8aacc5e22\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b568506a31b9f888e117dbeba01529c8aacc5e22\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9d4dfc9ab29d6e8916d3644e4b6c88047e6d3634\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9d4dfc9ab29d6e8916d3644e4b6c88047e6d3634\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3eb813de395f828e7a0c978ca78e5364c5a35078\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3eb813de395f828e7a0c978ca78e5364c5a35078\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6b646c614dfc3377a328b459f362adcabd6d7e0f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6b646c614dfc3377a328b459f362adcabd6d7e0f\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4e48a083a2832aa2a491de3ee4ea2f46743dccee\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4e48a083a2832aa2a491de3ee4ea2f46743dccee\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"855\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>이렇게만 설명해주고, 4명이 한 조니까 한 사람당 3문제씩 풀면 된다고 알려주고 어려운 부분들은 순회지도 하며 도와줬습니다. 진짜 아예 모르는 친구들은 열심히 자르고 붙이고 쓰레기 치우면서 참여했습니다.<br>&#160;분자모형은 프로그램에서 정답을 알지 못해 좀 엉망이기도 하지만 ㅋㅋ 그래도 화살표 양쪽 원자 개수 맞추기는 할 수 있는 것 같았어요... 다 완성한 모둠에게는 초콜렛을 준다고 하니까 정말 집중해서 완성은 해냅니다.. 검사하는 데 시간이 꽤 걸려서 나중에는 그냥 완성하면 막 초콜렛을 주게 되었지만... 이제야 검토해보는 결과물 사진 몇 개 첨부합니다. 다시보니 화학식 모형까지는 프로그램에서 정답 체크가 안되니까 마음대로 그렸습니다....ㅎㅎㅎ 이 부분은 다음 수업 때 피드백 해주면 될 것 같습니다.<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/50957013eef1d389b350fead77ed511e62767a6c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/50957013eef1d389b350fead77ed511e62767a6c\" data-origin-width=\"2533\" data-origin-height=\"1633\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/844bb959684763746fcc3b575e4e76866cd26b4e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/844bb959684763746fcc3b575e4e76866cd26b4e\" data-origin-width=\"2657\" data-origin-height=\"1143\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a470842428ece6108ce57d2c65b2e638348efb03\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a470842428ece6108ce57d2c65b2e638348efb03\" data-origin-width=\"2498\" data-origin-height=\"1208\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>(저희 학교는 과학에 흥미가 많이 없어요 ㅠ)<br>이제까지 화학반응식 할 때 다들 너무 힘들어했는데 이 활동은 나름 활동적으로 잘 참여한 것 같아서 올려봅니다....</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
